  "title": "Turkey BBQ Sandwiches",
  "description": "Slow-cooked turkey legs simmer in a tangy sauce all day before being shredded to make a budget-friendly yet tasty barbecue filling for sandwiches. Serve on buns and top with coleslaw.",
  "authors": [
    "Ashley Wilds"
